@page "/components/map"

<PageTitle>Map — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Map</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">Interactive MapLibre GL map, lazy-loaded. Separate package <code>Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn.Maps</code> so apps without maps never fetch 150KB MapLibre.</p>
<p class="doc-note">Style <code>Auto</code> follows site theme. Override via <code>window.lumeoCdn.mapLibreJs/Css</code> for self-host.</p>

<Map CenterLat="10.8231" CenterLng="106.6297" Zoom="12" Height="400px">
    <MapMarker Lat="10.8231" Lng="106.6297" Popup="Ho Chi Minh City" />
    <MapMarker Lat="10.762622" Lng="106.660172" Popup="District 1" />
</Map>

